        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glass fibre reinforced plastic, polyamide, injection moulding, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass fibre reinforced plastic, polyamide, injection moulding, at plant
Based on assumptions for material uses. Data for processing and infrastructure are assumed with generic inventory.;
Synonyms: GFK, GRP; 
UUID: 19a9ce72-bdcb-3ea8-a600-9d88b3376b8c
Gate to gate inventory for the injection moulding of glass fibre with polyamide resin including material inputs, process and infrastructure.
Location: Information from one manufacturer.
Technology: Injection moulding of glass fibre.
Time period: Time of publication
Production volume: na
Sampling: Personal communication 
Extrapolations: To European average. Background data for polyamide resin were not available. Its use has been approximated with melamine formaldehyde resin. 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_19a9ce72-bdcb-3ea8-a600-9d88b3376b8c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
